{"id":"436056","name":"韩式牛肉年糕汤","author":"朝族媳妇辣白菜","authorId":"10218894","desc":"","cover":"images/436056/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"年糕","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"大葱绿","amount":"1段"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所需食材。","img":"images/436056/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"年糕放水里泡20－30分钟。","img":"images/436056/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内倒入香油，放入牛肉炒熟。","img":"images/436056/step_3.gif"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入适量的水，煮30分钟左右。","img":"images/436056/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"葱绿切丝。","img":"images/436056/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/436056/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入泡好的年糕片。","img":"images/436056/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入酱油、盐、蒜末。","img":"images/436056/step_8.gif"},{"step":9,"desc":"鸡蛋打散倒入锅内成蛋花。","img":"images/436056/step_9.gif"},{"step":10,"desc":"熟开后，放入胡椒粉。","img":"images/436056/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入葱花。","img":"images/436056/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"韩式牛肉年糕汤就做好了。","img":"images/436056/step_12.gif"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}